/Title (Low-code platforms such as Zoho Creator are suitable for beginners because they provide visual development tools and built-in features for forms, reports, workflows, and dashboards. By gaining practical experience, learning database concepts, developing basic scripting skills, and completing real-world projects, students can build a strong portfolio and prepare for entry-level IT jobs. Furthermore, combining low-code knowledge with programming, API integration, and AI tools can help individuals expand their career opportunities and develop more advanced applications in the future.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 101 0 R
>>
